Kaioken rewrites cross-chapter mentions into relative .md links. Turn those
into routes inside the preview instead of dead file links.

function loadMermaid()
Mermaid is ~500KB, so it is imported only when a document actually contains a
diagram, and initialised once per session.

function SectionNav({ items, className, }: { items: SectionNavItem[] className?: string })
A sticky rail of section links with scroll-spy, for pages long enough that
you lose track of where you are. It parks under the fixed site header and
scrolls sideways on phones rather than wrapping to two rows.

