the smooth scroll comes from html{scroll-behavior} in index.css.

function TerminalWindow({ title = "kaioken", meta, scanlines = false, className, bodyClassName, children, ...props }: TerminalWindowProps)
The chrome every code / output sample on the site sits in. Square corners and
a flat title bar — a terminal is not a rounded card.

